Package: grip
Type: Package
Title: Graph dRawing with Intelligent Placement (GRIP)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pawel", "Gajer", , "pgajer@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Pawel Gajer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pawel Gajer <pgajer@gmail.com>
Description: Implements the GRIP algorithm for drawing large graphs using
    a multiscale force-directed method in 2D and 3D. Supports edge-list
    and adjacency-list inputs, optional positive edge weights,
    disconnected-component packing, and a lightweight plotting helper.
    Based on Gajer and Kobourov (2002) <doi:10.7155/jgaa.00052> and
    Gajer, Goodrich and Kobourov (2004)
    <doi:10.1016/j.comgeo.2004.03.014>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: Rcpp
Suggests:
    bslib,
    DT,
    htmltools,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    rgl,
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
